<h2>Website search</h2>
This crude search script will perform a simple keyword search on 
the top directory of this site.  If the search doesn't find something, it 
might be in my deeper directories.  But it will find lots.<br><p>

<FORM METHOD=POST ACTION="http://www.eskimo.com/cgi-bin/dirsearch.pl">
Enter one keyword:
<INPUT NAME=find><INPUT TYPE=SUBMIT value="Submit Search">
</FORM>
<br><p>

NOTE: Use <a href="http://www.altavista.digital.com">ALTAVISTA</a> to search my site.  Simply include this command
with
your list of keywords:  <b><large>+host:eskimo.com</large></b><br><p>
